      "easing": "easeInQuart"
    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "はい、できたよ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、ありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "えっと、あの……濃すぎたりとか、しない……？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、美味いぞ。しかし、甜花に\r\nコーヒーを淹れてもらえるなんて、不思議な感じだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ、よかった……\r\n甜花も……ちょっとずつ、変わってるから……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\n本当にいろんな面で成長したよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "アイドルの、お仕事も……\r\n最近、いっぱい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事が詰まってて大変だと思うけど、大丈夫か？\r\nもし無理なことがあったら、すぐに言ってくれよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……そのときは、そうするね……\r\nでも今は……楽しいから……大丈夫……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……ね、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花を、アイドルにしてくれて……\r\nありがとう……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　どうしたんだ、急に？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "最近、忙しくて……\r\nゆっくり……お話、できてなかったから……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ほんとは……ずっと、お礼……言いたかった……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お礼を言われるようなことなんかしてないさ\r\n俺はただ手助けをしただけだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "ううん……甜花が、ここまで来られたのは……\r\nきっと、プロデューサーさんが、いてくれたから……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんがいなかったら……甜花は……\r\n転んでも……起き上がれなかった……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺がいたからじゃなくて、\r\n甜花が頑張ったからこれだけのアイドルになれたんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110170,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "いっぱい、頑張れたのも……\r\nプロデューサーさんのおかげ……だよ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110180,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんは……\r\n甜花を、ちゃんとアイドルとして、育ててくれた……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花が頑張れると思ったから、俺は助けたんだ\r\n甜花は強い子だからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110190,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花が……強い……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "lip_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。何度転んでも立ち上がるなんて、\r\n強くなくちゃできないことなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110200,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……そっか……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110210,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーさんが、いなかったら……\r\nきっと……アイドル、続けられなかった……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110220,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花は今……ファンのみんなに、喜んでほしい……\r\nだから……レッスンも、お仕事も……頑張る……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110230,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……でも、一番は……プロデューサーさんに、\r\nもっと、もっと……甜花の成長を、見ててほしい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110240,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "きっと、プロデューサーさんと、一緒なら……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110250,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花ひとりじゃ……絶対、行けないところ……\r\n行ける、気がするから……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110260,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だから、ずっと、ずっと……\r\n一緒に……いてほしい……な",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n俺も甜花の成長をずっと見ていたいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……甜花、そんな姿を俺に見せてくれるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110270,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うん……\r\nありがとう……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015003110280,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "これからも、よろしくね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500311/2015003110280"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
